  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) sits among sons",
  "[action] sits among sons",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his dislike of his sons' cities.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and what good is it for a man to wear a coat with a long tail to it and to walk about with a small round hat on his head, which is only to be seen in the towns and cities? I do not know what sort of men these city men are, but they are not good enough for my sons.\"",
  "[action] sits and smokes pipe",
  "Wang Lung: \"Pear Blossom, take my pipe and put it down. What need is there for me to smoke?\"",
  "[action] stares at sons",
  "[action] Wang Lung stares at his sons and feels a pang of sadness.",
